sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Support lead
    participant H as Assistant host
    participant M as MCP endpoint
    participant J as Durable report service
    U->>H: Find delayed orders
    H->>M: tools/call with per-request capabilities
    M-->>H: input_required with report_window
    H->>U: Ask for date range
    U-->>H: Submit dates
    H->>M: New request ID, inputResponses, echoed state
    M->>M: Validate caller, state, and dates
    M->>J: Create or recover the authorized operation
    J-->>M: Durable job record
    M-->>H: Task handle through negotiated extension
    Note over H,J: Client saves the handle and the job survives reconnect
    H->>M: tasks/get with the saved handle
    M->>J: Check access and read current state
    J-->>M: Status or completed report
    M-->>H: Task status with result when complete
    H-->>U: Show report, optionally with an MCP App
